    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Trees</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Bottom-up height</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/balanced-binary-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 110</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Balanced Binary Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Compute heights bottom-up and let each call return either its height or -1 for \"unbalanced below me\", so every node is visited once and the first failure stops the walk. O(n) time, O(h) stack.</p>\n"
